11
01:00:10,588 --> 01:00:16,588
Raising the Bar is a 2016 documentary film that follows six young individuals with Down syndrome from Australia
and India who perform a dance routine at the World Down Syndrome Congress 2015 in Chennai, India.

12
01:05:38,823 --> 01:05:44,823
The film is directed by Onir and co-produced by Mitu Bhowmick Lange
and e.motion21, a non-profit Australian organisation.

13
01:11:07,058 --> 01:11:13,058
The film won the Best Documentary award at the
Melbourne City Independent Film Awards 2018.

14
01:16:35,294 --> 01:16:41,294
It was part of the official selection at the Maryland International Film
Festival 2017 and the Ethan Saylor Memorial Film Festival 2017.

15
01:22:03,529 --> 01:22:09,529
The film explores themes of sports, gymnastics, gymnast.

16
01:27:31,764 --> 01:27:37,764
The tone is emotional.
